#: code:addons/odossey_ophthalmology/models/oph_certificate.py:0
msgid ""
"I certify that %(name)s, ID %(doc)s, examined on %(date)s, must use his/her "
"optical correction permanently."
msgstr ""
"Certifico que %(name)s, DNI %(doc)s, examinado/a el %(date)s, debe usar su "
"corrección óptica en forma permanente."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/odossey_ophthalmology/models/oph_certificate.py:0
msgid ""
"I certify that %(name)s, ID %(doc)s, was attended on %(date)s and requires "
"%(days)s days of rest from that date for ophthalmological reasons."
msgstr ""
"Certifico que %(name)s, DNI %(doc)s, fue atendido/a el %(date)s y requiere "
"%(days)s días de reposo a partir de esa fecha por razones oftalmológicas."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/odossey_ophthalmology/models/oph_certificate.py:0
msgid ""
"I certify that %(name)s, ID %(doc)s, was examined on %(date)s and presents "
"no ophthalmological contraindication for school and sports activities."
msgstr ""
"Certifico que %(name)s, DNI %(doc)s, fue examinado/a el %(date)s y no "
"presenta contraindicaciones oftalmológicas para actividades escolares y "
"deportivas."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/odossey_ophthalmology/models/oph_certificate.py:0
msgid "I certify that %(name)s, ID %(doc)s, was examined on %(date)s."
msgstr "Certifico que %(name)s, DNI %(doc)s, fue examinado/a el %(date)s."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/odossey_ophthalmology/models/oph_certificate.py:0
msgid ""
"I certify that %(name)s, ID %(doc)s, was examined on %(date)s. Visual "
"acuity: right eye %(od)s, left eye %(os)s. Visual field and color vision "
"within normal limits. The patient is FIT from the visual point of view to "
"drive vehicles%(glasses)s."
msgstr ""
"Certifico que %(name)s, DNI %(doc)s, fue examinado/a el %(date)s. Agudeza "
"visual: ojo derecho %(od)s, ojo izquierdo %(os)s. Campo visual y visión "
"cromática dentro de límites normales. El/la paciente se encuentra APTO/A "
"desde el punto de vista visual para conducir vehículos%(glasses)s."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:oph.consent.template,body:odossey_ophthalmology.consent_template_glaucoma
msgid ""
"I commit to attend the controls, which are frequent during the first weeks. "
"I can revoke this consent before the procedure (Law 26.529). Date: {date}."
msgstr ""
"Me comprometo a asistir a los controles, que son frecuentes durante las "
"primeras semanas. Puedo revocar este consentimiento antes del procedimiento "
"(Ley 26.529). Fecha: {date}."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:oph.consent.template,body:odossey_ophthalmology.consent_template_refractive
msgid ""
"I commit to follow the post-operative indications and controls. I can revoke"
" this consent before the procedure (Law 26.529). Date: {date}."
msgstr ""
"Me comprometo a cumplir las indicaciones y los controles postoperatorios. "
"Puedo revocar este consentimiento antes del procedimiento (Ley 26.529). "
"Fecha: {date}."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:oph.consent.template,body:odossey_ophthalmology.consent_template_surgery
msgid ""
"I have been informed about the purpose of the procedure, the expected "
"benefits, the alternatives (including not having it done), the type of "
"anesthesia and the most frequent and the most serious risks: infection, "
"bleeding, inflammation, increase of the eye pressure, need of a new surgery "
"and, exceptionally, loss of vision."
msgstr ""
"Fui informado/a sobre el objetivo del procedimiento, los beneficios "
"esperados, las alternativas (incluida la de no realizarlo), el tipo de "
"anestesia y los riesgos más frecuentes y más graves: infección, sangrado, "
"inflamación, aumento de la presión ocular, necesidad de una nueva cirugía y,"
" excepcionalmente, pérdida de la visión."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:oph.consent.template,body:odossey_ophthalmology.consent_template_refractive
msgid ""
"I have been informed of the possible risks: residual or regressive "
"refractive error that may need a retreatment, dry eye, halos and glare at "
"night, flap complications (LASIK), pain and slower recovery (PRK), corneal "
"haze, infection and, exceptionally, corneal ectasia. Presbyopia is not "
"corrected and will appear with age."
msgstr ""
"Fui informado/a de los riesgos posibles: defecto refractivo residual o "
"regresión que puede requerir un retoque, ojo seco, halos y deslumbramiento "
"nocturno, complicaciones del flap (LASIK), dolor y recuperación más lenta "
"(PRK), opacidad corneal, infección y, excepcionalmente, ectasia corneal. La "
"presbicia no se corrige y aparecerá con la edad."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:odossey_ophthalmology.portal_consent_page
msgid "I have read and understood this document and I give my consent."
msgstr "Leí y comprendí este documento y doy mi consentimiento."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:oph.consent.template,body:odossey_ophthalmology.consent_template_surgery
msgid ""
"I understand that medicine is not an exact science and that no specific "
"result can be guaranteed. I commit to follow the indications and to attend "
"the post-operative controls. I can revoke this consent before the procedure "
"(Law 26.529). Date: {date}."
msgstr ""
"Comprendo que la medicina no es una ciencia exacta y que no se puede "
"garantizar un resultado determinado. Me comprometo a cumplir las "
"indicaciones y a asistir a los controles postoperatorios. Puedo revocar este"
" consentimiento antes del procedimiento (Ley 26.529). Fecha: {date}."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:oph.consent.template,body:odossey_ophthalmology.consent_template_general
msgid ""
"I understand that the dilating drops may cause blurred vision and "
"sensitivity to light for several hours, so I must not drive afterwards, and "
"that, exceptionally, they may cause an increase of the eye pressure or "
"allergic reactions."
msgstr ""
"Comprendo que las gotas para dilatar pueden producir visión borrosa y "
"sensibilidad a la luz durante varias horas, por lo que no debo conducir "
"después, y que excepcionalmente pueden provocar un aumento de la presión "
"ocular o reacciones alérgicas."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:oph.consent.template,body:odossey_ophthalmology.consent_template_general
msgid ""
"I was able to ask all my questions, I know that I can revoke this consent at"
" any time (Law 26.529) and I authorize {company} to perform these "
"examinations and to keep my clinical record. Date: {date}."
msgstr ""
"Pude realizar todas mis preguntas, sé que puedo revocar este consentimiento "
"en cualquier momento (Ley 26.529) y autorizo a {company} a realizar estos "
"exámenes y a conservar mi historia clínica. Fecha: {date}."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:oph.consent.template,body:odossey_ophthalmology.consent_template_intravitreal
msgid ""
"I, {patient}, ID {document}, authorize the treatment {procedure}: the "
"injection of a medication (anti-VEGF or corticosteroid) inside the eye, "
"under sterile conditions and topical anesthesia, to treat my macular or "
"retinal disease. I understand that several injections are usually needed."
msgstr ""
"Yo, {patient}, DNI {document}, autorizo el tratamiento {procedure}: la "
"inyección de un medicamento (anti-VEGF o corticoide) dentro del ojo, en "
"condiciones estériles y con anestesia tópica, para tratar mi enfermedad "
"macular o retinal. Comprendo que habitualmente se necesitan varias "
"inyecciones."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:oph.consent.template,body:odossey_ophthalmology.consent_template_surgery
msgid ""
"I, {patient}, ID {document}, authorize {doctor} and the surgical team of "
"{company} to perform the following procedure: {procedure}."
msgstr ""
"Yo, {patient}, DNI {document}, autorizo a {doctor} y al equipo quirúrgico de"
" {company} a realizarme el siguiente procedimiento: {procedure}."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:oph.consent.template,body:odossey_ophthalmology.consent_template_cataract
msgid ""
"I, {patient}, ID {document}, have been diagnosed with cataract. The surgery "
"({procedure}) consists of removing the opaque lens through a small incision "
"by phacoemulsification and replacing it with an intraocular lens whose power"
" is calculated from the biometry."
msgstr ""
"Yo, {patient}, DNI {document}, fui diagnosticado/a de catarata. La cirugía "
"({procedure}) consiste en extraer el cristalino opacificado a través de una "
"incisión pequeña mediante facoemulsificación y reemplazarlo por un lente "
"intraocular cuya potencia se calcula a partir de la biometría."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:oph.consent.template,body:odossey_ophthalmology.consent_template_glaucoma
msgid ""
"I, {patient}, ID {document}, have glaucoma, a chronic disease that damages "
"the optic nerve. The procedure {procedure} aims to lower the eye pressure to"
" slow down the damage; it does not recover the vision already lost."
msgstr ""
"Yo, {patient}, DNI {document}, tengo glaucoma, una enfermedad crónica que "
"daña el nervio óptico. El procedimiento {procedure} busca bajar la presión "
"ocular para frenar el daño; no recupera la visión ya perdida."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:oph.consent.template,body:odossey_ophthalmology.consent_template_refractive
msgid ""
"I, {patient}, ID {document}, request the refractive surgery {procedure} to "
"reduce my dependence on glasses or contact lenses. I know that it is an "
"elective procedure and that glasses and contact lenses are valid "
"alternatives."
msgstr ""
"Yo, {patient}, DNI {document}, solicito la cirugía refractiva {procedure} "
"para reducir mi dependencia de anteojos o lentes de contacto. Sé que es un "
"procedimiento electivo y que los anteojos y las lentes de contacto son "
"alternativas válidas."

#. module: odossey_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:oph.consent.template,body:odossey_ophthalmology.consent_template_general
msgid ""
"I, {patient}, ID {document}, state that I have been clearly informed by "
"{doctor} about my eye health and about the examinations that will be "
"performed: visual acuity, refraction, tonometry, dilation of the pupils with"
" drops, slit lamp examination, fundus examination and the complementary "
"studies that may be needed."
msgstr ""
"Yo, {patient}, DNI {document}, declaro haber sido informado/a en forma clara"
" por {doctor} sobre mi estado de salud visual y sobre los exámenes que se me"
" realizarán: agudeza visual, refracción, tonometría, dilatación de las "
"pupilas con gotas, biomicroscopía, fondo de ojo y los estudios "
"complementarios que sean necesarios."

